DESCRIPTION:You are required to form your groups according to the professor
 ’s designated group structure. You should select one country from the li
 st provided in the course slides and prepare a video based on your chosen 
 country according to the instructions provided in the course slides for We
 ek 1.\n\nYour work should be developed around the two central notions disc
 ussed in class: Power and State Interest. These concepts should serve as t
 he analytical foundation of your video and guide the way you approach and 
 present your chosen country.
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:Video Assignment  [INT202]
