 versity\, only 2-3 groups per theme will be accepted\, and case studies wi
 thin the same theme must differ.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style="
 font-size: 12pt\;"><strong>Use of AI Tools:</strong> AI tools\, such as ch
 atbots\, can be used for topic suggestions and to help the group generate 
 / organise initial ideas. However\, the primary focus should be on using A
 I to assist in outlining and organising preliminary thoughts rather than r
 elying mindlessly on AI-generated content.</span></p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p><spa
 n style="font-size: 12pt\;"><strong>Interactive AI Use:</strong> Groups sh
 ould use well-crafted prompts to engage with the AI tool\, namely to gener
