 ary list of references is sensible but incomplete and denotes a superficia
 l level of screening.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt\;">
 Sources referencing do not all comply with APA style rules (lack of consis
 tency).</span></p>\n<p><span style="font-style: inherit\; font-size: 12pt\
 ;">&nbsp\;</span><span style="font-style: inherit\; font-size: 1rem\;">Col
 laboration is limited or uneven\, with substantial task-splitting and litt
 le evidence of members engaging critically with each other’s contributio
 ns. The version history shows some drafting and revision\, but the develop
 ment process is relatively limited or concentrated close to the deadline.<
 /span></p>\n<p>AI use broadly complies with the rules\, but there may be<s
 pan>&nbsp\;</span><strong data-start="2769" data-end="2917">weak documenta
 tion\, overreliance across all phases of the proposal\, or insufficient di
 stinction between AI-assisted and independently produced material</strong>
 .</p>\n<p>References are<span>&nbsp\;</span><strong data-start="2977" data
 -end="3006">incomplete or superficial</strong>\, showing only limited scre
 ening of relevant literature. Referencing has noticeable APA inconsistenci
 es\; some sources may be unreliable.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style="font-st
 yle: inherit\;">\n<td style="font-style: inherit\; width: 9.85532%\;">\n<p
 ><span style="font-style: inherit\; font-size: 12pt\;">Failed</span></p>\n
 <p><span style="font-style: inherit\; font-size: 12pt\;">1-9</span></p>\n<
 /td>\n<td style="font-style: inherit\; width: 90.1495%\;">\n<p><span style
 ="font-style: inherit\; font-size: 12pt\;">&nbsp\;</span></p>\n<p><span st
 yle="font-style: inherit\; font-size: 12pt\;">The proposal lacks in a majo
 rity of areas. Ideas are poorly organized and articulated\, and the struct
 ure of the proposal deviates substantially from the format recommended.</s
 pan></p>\n<p><span style="font-style: inherit\; font-size: 12pt\;">The res
 earch question is ambiguous and lacks pertinence. The research design and 
 methodology are completely misaligned with the research question\, and its
  analytical logic/or feasibility is problematic. The abstract fails to sum
 marize the research puzzle\, aims and relevance of the case study\, and th
 e organization of ideas is very confusing. </span></p>\n<p data-start="396
 5" data-end="3995">Little evidence of genuine collaborative work or indepe
 ndent intellectual engagement. Significant task-splitting\, no collective 
 revision. The version history provides little evidence of collective discu
 ssion\, revision\, or progressive development of the work.</p>\n<p data-st
 art="3965" data-end="3995">There is evidence of<span>&nbsp\;</span><strong
  data-start="3403" data-end="3454">AI use beyond the permitted brainstormi
 ng phase</strong>\, undisclosed AI-generated material\, or substantial rel
 iance on AI in producing the content or analysis.</p>\n<p><span style="fon
 t-style: inherit\; font-size: 12pt\;">The preliminary list of references d
 enotes a very superficial screening level and poor familiarity with the re
 levant literature. </span>The references are<span>&nbsp\;</span><strong da
 ta-start="3855" data-end="3903">minimal\, inappropriate<span>&nbsp\;</span
 ></strong>(mostly blogs\, websites\, newspapers)<strong data-start="3855" 
 data-end="3903">\, or poorly integrated</strong>\, demonstrating weak enga
 gement with relevant literature.&nbsp\; Referencing is<span>&nbsp\;</span>
 <strong data-start="4239" data-end="4265">inconsistent or absent</strong><
 span>&nbsp\;</span>(e.g.\, raw links\, non-APA style).</p>\n<p>&nbsp\;</p>
 \n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style="font-style: inherit\; width: 9.85532%\;">
 \n<p><span style="font-style: inherit\; font-size: 12pt\;">Unacceptable</s
 pan></p>\n<p><span style="font-style: inherit\; font-size: 12pt\;">0</span
 ></p>\n</td>\n<td style="font-style: inherit\; width: 90.1495%\;">\n<p><sp
 an style="font-style: inherit\; font-size: 12pt\;">No proposal submitted</
 span></p>\n<p><span style="font-style: inherit\; font-size: 12pt\;">or</sp
 an></p>\n<p><span style="font-style: inherit\;"><span style="font-size: 12
 pt\;">plagiarised proposa</span>l</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</ta
 ble>
END:VEVENT
